  unitName: Humanity Betrayer Nelson (EU)
  unitId: 720247
  unitNumber: 7219
  description: "If Nelson had decided to not hide his secret, his destiny would have
    been quite different. The extremist Robespierre would have done everything in
    his power to harm the Admiral, accusing him of treason. Nelson and his wife would
    have then become fugitives. They would have taken refuge with Cornelius, despite
    some reticence on his part at first. Nevertheless, the presence of a man who
    was very skilled and well informed on his enemies would have convinced him to
    accept. Over time, Nelson would become the Shapeshifters\u2019 right-hand man
    and together they would have been able to destroy the Republic."
  summonDesc: 
  fusionDesc: "I won\u2019t let you harm my new family!"
  evoDesc: "Sacrifice humanity? It doesn\u2019t matter. I\u2019d do anything for
    you!"
  element: 2
  rarity: 0
